  "body": "it would be nice to be able to access all steam controllers gyro directly . (2015, deck and 2026 versions)\nwithout any 3rd party tools since sdl support gyros of the switch and playstation controllers.\nand not being stuck to assign the steam controllers gyro as mouse for example for emulators like cemu or azahar or eden.\nI probably won't buy another steam product and go for a 3rd party controller unless this bug is fixed.\n",
